# design-sync build output (`--out`). Regenerated in full on every run — the
# converter rm -rf's this directory, so nothing tracked may live inside it,
# which is why it is ignored from here rather than by a .gitignore of its own.
#
# It sits here rather than at the repo root because the root .gitignore is a
# governance-sensitive path an agent cannot add to, and not under
# .design-sync/ because the converter refuses [OUT_UNSAFE] to rm anything in
# that tree (hand-authored previews and notes live there).
ds-bundle/
